> (whatever that is).
> 
> Do you know how I can configure Putty to look like a DOS window?
> 

From http://nethack.wikia.com/wiki/PuTTY


 To make IBMgraphics work with PuTTY, you need to set
 Window/Translation/Character Set to CP437

 To make PuTTY looks exactly like the Windows terminal window, set
 Windows/Appearance/Font to Terminal 


